[01:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'mostly be going over changes this week. Anyway, a couple of nodes I\'ve been playing with in the model chain are CFG zero star and Create two enhancer. The note describes what they do. CFG zero'

[01:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'star zeros out the model\'s predictions during the earliest steps of the sampling process to hopefully improve details and prompt adherence. The Create two T enhancer patches the Create two'

[01:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'text fusion path during sampling and applies a controlled internal conditioning adjustment, once again intended to improve how strongly the model follows prompt details. As'

[01:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'pictures paint a thousand words, let\'s take a look at what they do in practice. The prompt I\'m using for tests to start with is this slightly long and complex one here. It features a number of'

[02:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
