[14:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'it kind of works when you have a decent user prompt. This version has all of the required elements in place, and it can spell properly, too. We\'ve got the window, rodent, purple chair, little hat, TV, obey posters. It\'s all come out'

[15:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'really well. Now, I\'ll show you a couple of ways which may help with the spellings when you\'re using the other nodes in just a the but first, let\'s take a look at what happens if you just use that prompt by itself, so no images'

[15:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'at all. Here we can see the spelling is still very good, but in this version, of course, we don\'t get the purple chair, and we don\'t get the hat because none of the images we used is just that base'

[15:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'prompt. Okay, so if you\'re trying to get text from your prompt to generate properly, then this method may help. First of all, use a lower strength for the image. In this case, I\'ve used the low preset in'

