VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'text, I highly suggest using the Ernie model. Not only will it repair most of the text, but it will also add some detail and sharpen things up, too. Then we can do the second pass with Korea on'

[16:30] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'top of that, if needed. The comparison node shows us the original to start with, and as I move across, you can see how Ernie has helped to repair that text. Very nice. Now, both the TV and the posters are looking'

[16:44] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'much better. The second upscale pass takes us to 2400 by 1336, and now we\'ve got perfect text. Loads of detail in his clothing, you can see'

